  "<section class=\"metadata-panel\"><h3>内部信息</h3><p class=\"field-help\">按需查看照片参数、媒体标签或文档属性。不会修改内容；本机文件显示读取时的信息。</p><label class=\"field\">查看对象<select id=\"metadata-target\">⟦0⟧</select></label><label class=\"metadata-location\"><input id=\"metadata-location\" type=\"checkbox\"> 包含照片位置信息</label><div class=\"metadata-actions\"><button id=\"metadata-read\" type=\"button\">读取内部信息</button><button id=\"metadata-cancel\" type=\"button\" hidden>取消读取</button></div><p id=\"metadata-feedback\" class=\"field-help\" role=\"status\"></p><dl id=\"metadata-values\"></dl></section>": "<section class=\"metadata-panel\"><h3>Metadata</h3><p class=\"field-help\">Read photo details, media tags or document properties on demand. Content is not modified. Local file information reflects the time of reading.</p><label class=\"field\">Item to inspect<select id=\"metadata-target\">⟦0⟧</select></label><label class=\"metadata-location\"><input id=\"metadata-location\" type=\"checkbox\"> Include photo location</label><div class=\"metadata-actions\"><button id=\"metadata-read\" type=\"button\">Read metadata</button><button id=\"metadata-cancel\" type=\"button\" hidden>Cancel reading</button></div><p id=\"metadata-feedback\" class=\"field-help\" role=\"status\"></p><dl id=\"metadata-values\"></dl></section>",
