  "<div class=\"stack-rule-grid\"><label class=\"field\">内容类型<select id=\"stack-kind\">⟦0⟧</select></label><label class=\"field\">加入方式<select id=\"stack-mode\"><option value=\"whole\" ⟦1⟧>整条加入</option><option value=\"lines\" ⟦2⟧>文字按行拆分</option></select></label></div><label class=\"field\">来源应用（可选）<input id=\"stack-source\" maxlength=\"256\" value=\"⟦3⟧\" placeholder=\"进程名，例如 notepad.exe\"></label><label class=\"field\">包含文字（可选）<input id=\"stack-contains\" maxlength=\"256\" value=\"⟦4⟧\" placeholder=\"正文、文件路径或附件名称\"></label><label class=\"efficiency-toggle\"><input id=\"stack-trim\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦5⟧>拆分时去除每行首尾空白</label><p class=\"field-help\">同时满足条件才加入。按行拆分保存为纯文本并跳过空行；图片和文件仍需选择整条加入。相同内容保持第一次入栈的位置，最多 200 项。</p>": "<div class=\"stack-rule-grid\"><label class=\"field\">Content type<select id=\"stack-kind\">⟦0⟧</select></label><label class=\"field\">Add mode<select id=\"stack-mode\"><option value=\"whole\" ⟦1⟧>Whole record</option><option value=\"lines\" ⟦2⟧>Split text into lines</option></select></label></div><label class=\"field\">Source app (optional)<input id=\"stack-source\" maxlength=\"256\" value=\"⟦3⟧\" placeholder=\"Process name, e.g. notepad.exe\"></label><label class=\"field\">Contains text (optional)<input id=\"stack-contains\" maxlength=\"256\" value=\"⟦4⟧\" placeholder=\"Text, file path or attachment name\"></label><label class=\"efficiency-toggle\"><input id=\"stack-trim\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦5⟧>Trim whitespace around each line</label><p class=\"field-help\">All conditions must match. Splitting lines saves plain text and skips empty lines; use Whole record for images and files. Duplicates keep their first position in the stack. Up to 200 items.</p>",
  "已保存堆栈规则": "Stack rules saved",
  "<p class=\"field-help\">使用已保存的堆栈规则筛选历史，只追加到队尾，原记录保留。</p><div class=\"stack-preview-toolbar\"><label class=\"field\">排列顺序<select id=\"stack-order\"><option value=\"oldest\">由旧到新</option><option value=\"newest\">由新到旧</option></select></label><button id=\"stack-preview\" type=\"button\">预览匹配结果</button></div><p id=\"stack-summary\" role=\"status\">先预览，再确认加入。</p><ol id=\"stack-samples\" class=\"stack-samples\"></ol>": "<p class=\"field-help\">Filters history using your saved stack rules and appends matches to the end. Original records are kept.</p><div class=\"stack-preview-toolbar\"><label class=\"field\">Order<select id=\"stack-order\"><option value=\"oldest\">Oldest first</option><option value=\"newest\">Newest first</option></select></label><button id=\"stack-preview\" type=\"button\">Preview matches</button></div><p id=\"stack-summary\" role=\"status\">Preview matches before adding them.</p><ol id=\"stack-samples\" class=\"stack-samples\"></ol>",
