  "<section class=\"tools-page data-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>数据与备份</h1><p>保留一份随时可以恢复的副本</p></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><div id=\"history-vault\"></div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>当前存储</h2><button id=\"migrate-storage\">迁移目录</button></div><div class=\"storage-location\"><code id=\"storage-directory\">⟦0⟧</code><small>数据库与日志 ⟦1⟧ · 历史、模板、分类、脚本与本机配置</small></div>⟦2⟧<p class=\"field-help\">迁移会校验完整副本后切换，原目录保留；文件记录引用的源文件不会搬动。应用缓存与位置配置仍保存在默认目录。</p><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>自动备份</h2><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"backup-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦3⟧>启用</label></div><label class=\"field\">备份文件夹<div class=\"data-path-row\"><input id=\"backup-directory\" readonly value=\"⟦4⟧\"><button id=\"backup-choose-folder\">选择文件夹</button></div></label><div class=\"tool-field-grid\"><label class=\"field\">间隔（小时）<input id=\"backup-interval\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"168\" value=\"⟦5⟧\"></label><label class=\"field\">保留最近几份<input id=\"backup-keep\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" value=\"⟦6⟧\"></label></div><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"backup-encrypted\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦7⟧>使用密码加密备份</label><div class=\"tool-field-grid\" id=\"backup-password-fields\"><label class=\"field\">备份密码<input id=\"backup-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" maxlength=\"1024\" placeholder=\"⟦8⟧\"></label><label class=\"field\">再次输入新密码<input id=\"backup-password-repeat\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" maxlength=\"1024\" placeholder=\"填写新密码时确认\"></label></div><p class=\"field-help\">请自行保存密码，忘记后无法恢复。更换密码只影响新备份；改用明文会清除已保存的密码。备份包括历史、模板、分类和脚本，不包含 API 密钥、本机设置或源文件本体。</p><div class=\"data-controls\"><button id=\"save-backup-settings\" class=\"primary\">保存备份设置</button><button id=\"backup-now\" ⟦9⟧>立即备份</button><span id=\"data-feedback\"></span></div><div class=\"backup-status\" id=\"backup-status\"></div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>备份记录</h2><div><button id=\"protected-export\">手动导出</button><button id=\"restore-file\">从文件恢复</button></div></div><p class=\"field-help\">新备份完成并通过校验后，才清理超出保留数量的本应用自动备份。手动导出和其他文件不会被清理。</p><div id=\"backup-entries\"></div></div></section>": "<section class=\"tools-page data-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>Data & backup</h1><p>Keep a copy you can restore</p></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><div id=\"history-vault\"></div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>Current storage</h2><button id=\"migrate-storage\">Move storage</button></div><div class=\"storage-location\"><code id=\"storage-directory\">⟦0⟧</code><small>Database and logs: ⟦1⟧ · History, templates, categories, scripts and local settings</small></div>⟦2⟧<p class=\"field-help\">Storage switches after the full copy is verified. The original folder is kept; referenced source files are not moved. App caches and location settings remain in the default folder.</p><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>Automatic backups</h2><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"backup-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦3⟧>Enable</label></div><label class=\"field\">Backup folder<div class=\"data-path-row\"><input id=\"backup-directory\" readonly value=\"⟦4⟧\"><button id=\"backup-choose-folder\">Choose folder</button></div></label><div class=\"tool-field-grid\"><label class=\"field\">Interval (hours)<input id=\"backup-interval\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"168\" value=\"⟦5⟧\"></label><label class=\"field\">Backups to keep<input id=\"backup-keep\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"100\" value=\"⟦6⟧\"></label></div><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"backup-encrypted\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦7⟧>Encrypt backups with a password</label><div class=\"tool-field-grid\" id=\"backup-password-fields\"><label class=\"field\">Backup password<input id=\"backup-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" maxlength=\"1024\" placeholder=\"⟦8⟧\"></label><label class=\"field\">Repeat new password<input id=\"backup-password-repeat\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" maxlength=\"1024\" placeholder=\"Confirm when entering a new password\"></label></div><p class=\"field-help\">Keep your password safe; a forgotten password cannot be recovered. Changing it affects only new backups. Switching to unencrypted backups clears the saved password. Backups include history, templates, categories and scripts, but not API keys, local settings or referenced source files.</p><div class=\"data-controls\"><button id=\"save-backup-settings\" class=\"primary\">Save backup settings</button><button id=\"backup-now\" ⟦9⟧>Back up now</button><span id=\"data-feedback\"></span></div><div class=\"backup-status\" id=\"backup-status\"></div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>Backup history</h2><div><button id=\"protected-export\">Export backup</button><button id=\"restore-file\">Restore from file</button></div></div><p class=\"field-help\">Older automatic backups beyond the retention limit are removed only after a new backup is completed and verified. Manual exports and other files are kept.</p><div id=\"backup-entries\"></div></div></section>",
