  "<p class=\"field-help\">⟦0⟧</p><div class=\"restore-summary\"><div><strong>⟦1⟧</strong><span>历史记录</span></div><div><strong>⟦2⟧</strong><span>快捷回复</span></div><div><strong>⟦3⟧</strong><span>分类</span></div><div><strong>⟦4⟧</strong><span>文本脚本</span></div></div><p class=\"field-help\">⟦5⟧ 将备份合并到当前资料，重复内容去重；已有设置和服务密钥保持。脚本只导入，不自动运行。恢复失败整体回滚。</p>": "<p class=\"field-help\">⟦0⟧</p><div class=\"restore-summary\"><div><strong>⟦1⟧</strong><span>History</span></div><div><strong>⟦2⟧</strong><span>Quick replies</span></div><div><strong>⟦3⟧</strong><span>Categories</span></div><div><strong>⟦4⟧</strong><span>Text scripts</span></div></div><p class=\"field-help\">⟦5⟧ Merge this backup into your current data, removing duplicates. Existing settings and service keys are kept. Scripts are imported without running. A failed restore rolls back all changes.</p>",
