  "，仅使用一次": "; single use",
  "<section class=\"tools-page sync-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>局域网同步</h1><p>让信任的电脑共享文字与图片</p></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><h2 class=\"section-label\">本机</h2><label class=\"field\">设备名称<input id=\"sync-name\" maxlength=\"60\" value=\"⟦0⟧\"></label><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"sync-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦1⟧>启用局域网同步</label><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"sync-auto\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦2⟧>自动同步之后新复制的文字与图片</label><p class=\"field-help\">默认不发送已有历史。仅本机内容、文件路径、设置和密钥不发送。共享记录不受自动清理影响，手动删除会同步到配对设备。</p><button id=\"sync-save\" class=\"primary\">保存同步设置</button><div id=\"sync-live\"></div><h2 class=\"section-label\">添加设备</h2><p class=\"field-help\">让两台电脑连接同一个局域网。生成配对码，交给另一台电脑，再核对设备名称并允许配对。Windows 防火墙需要允许 Clipper 访问专用网络。</p><div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><select id=\"sync-address\" aria-label=\"本机地址\">⟦3⟧</select><button id=\"sync-create\" ⟦4⟧>生成配对码</button></div><div id=\"sync-code-area\" hidden><textarea id=\"sync-invitation\" readonly rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"本机配对码\"></textarea><p id=\"sync-expiry\" class=\"field-help\"></p><button id=\"sync-select-code\">选中配对码</button><button id=\"sync-cancel-code\">取消配对码</button></div><label class=\"field\">另一台设备的配对码<textarea id=\"sync-join-code\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"4096\" placeholder=\"clipper-pair:…\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea></label><button id=\"sync-join\" ⟦5⟧>请求配对</button><h2 class=\"section-label\">选择已有内容</h2><p class=\"field-help\">只分享主动选择的记录。不同电脑离线编辑同一内容时保留各自的新结果。</p><div id=\"sync-clips\"></div></div></section>": "<section class=\"tools-page sync-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>LAN sync</h1><p>Share text and images with trusted computers</p></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><h2 class=\"section-label\">This device</h2><label class=\"field\">Device name<input id=\"sync-name\" maxlength=\"60\" value=\"⟦0⟧\"></label><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"sync-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦1⟧>Enable LAN sync</label><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"sync-auto\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦2⟧>Automatically sync text and images copied from now on</label><p class=\"field-help\">Existing history is not sent by default. Local-only content, file paths, settings and keys are not sent. Shared records are kept during automatic cleanup; manual deletions sync to paired devices.</p><button id=\"sync-save\" class=\"primary\">Save sync settings</button><div id=\"sync-live\"></div><h2 class=\"section-label\">Add a device</h2><p class=\"field-help\">Connect both computers to the same LAN. Generate a code for the other computer, check its device name, then allow pairing. Windows Firewall must allow Clipper on private networks.</p><div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><select id=\"sync-address\" aria-label=\"Local address\">⟦3⟧</select><button id=\"sync-create\" ⟦4⟧>Create pairing code</button></div><div id=\"sync-code-area\" hidden><textarea id=\"sync-invitation\" readonly rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"This device's pairing code\"></textarea><p id=\"sync-expiry\" class=\"field-help\"></p><button id=\"sync-select-code\">Select pairing code</button><button id=\"sync-cancel-code\">Cancel pairing code</button></div><label class=\"field\">Pairing code from the other device<textarea id=\"sync-join-code\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"4096\" placeholder=\"clipper-pair:…\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea></label><button id=\"sync-join\" ⟦5⟧>Request pairing</button><h2 class=\"section-label\">Choose existing content</h2><p class=\"field-help\">Only the records you choose are shared. Offline edits on different computers are kept as separate results.</p><div id=\"sync-clips\"></div></div></section>",
  "同步设置已保存": "Sync settings saved",
  "仅本机": "Local only",
  "尚未共享": "Not shared yet",
