  "<p class=\"field-help\">复制一些文字或图片后，可在这里选择共享。最多展示最近 100 条。</p>": "<p class=\"field-help\">Copy some text or images, then choose what to share here. Shows up to 100 recent records.</p>",
  "将内容设为仅本机": "Keep content local only",
  "<p>保留本机记录，撤回已经同步的发布；之后复制相同内容也不会自动共享。其他设备保存的备份不受影响。</p>": "<p>Keeps the local record and retracts its synced publication. Copying the same content again will not share it automatically. Backups saved on other devices are unaffected.</p>",
  "<div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>历史保护</h2><span class=\"vault-badge\">⟦0⟧</span></div><div class=\"vault-card\"><div class=\"vault-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⟦1⟧</div><div><h3>⟦2⟧</h3><p>⟦3⟧</p><div class=\"data-controls\">⟦4⟧</div></div></div>⟦5⟧⟦6⟧": "<div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>History protection</h2><span class=\"vault-badge\">⟦0⟧</span></div><div class=\"vault-card\"><div class=\"vault-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⟦1⟧</div><div><h3>⟦2⟧</h3><p>⟦3⟧</p><div class=\"data-controls\">⟦4⟧</div></div></div>⟦5⟧⟦6⟧",
  "已加密 · 当前已解锁": "Encrypted · Currently unlocked",
  "尚未加密": "Not encrypted",
  "每次打开，都先确认是你": "Confirm your identity when opening",
  "为剪贴板历史加一把锁": "Protect clipboard history",
  "历史、图片、模板与设置都保存在加密数据库中。锁定期间停止记录和共享。": "History, images, templates and settings are stored in an encrypted database. Capture and sharing stop while locked.",
  "使用密码加密本机数据库。解锁后可正常记录、搜索、粘贴；支持恢复密钥找回。": "Encrypt the local database with a password. Capture, search and paste normally after unlocking. A recovery key lets you regain access.",
  "<button id=\"vault-lock\" class=\"primary\">锁定历史</button><button id=\"vault-password\">更改密码</button>": "<button id=\"vault-lock\" class=\"primary\">Lock history</button><button id=\"vault-password\">Change password</button>",
  "<button id=\"vault-enable\" class=\"primary\">启用历史加密</button>": "<button id=\"vault-enable\" class=\"primary\">Encrypt history</button>",
  "<div class=\"vault-options\"><label class=\"field\">离开电脑后自动锁定<select id=\"vault-idle\">⟦0⟧</select></label><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"vault-hello\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦1⟧ ⟦2⟧>Windows Hello 快捷解锁⟦3⟧</label><p class=\"field-help\">锁屏或休眠时自动锁定。Hello 通过后，使用当前 Windows 账户保护的本机凭据解锁；换电脑仍需密码或恢复密钥。</p><button id=\"vault-save\">保存锁定设置</button></div>": "<div class=\"vault-options\"><label class=\"field\">Lock after inactivity<select id=\"vault-idle\">⟦0⟧</select></label><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"vault-hello\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦1⟧ ⟦2⟧>Unlock with Windows Hello⟦3⟧</label><p class=\"field-help\">Locks automatically on screen lock or sleep. After Hello verification, credentials protected by this Windows account unlock the local data. Another computer still requires the password or recovery key.</p><button id=\"vault-save\">Save lock settings</button></div>",
  " 分钟": " min",
  "不按空闲时间锁定": "No inactivity lock",
  "（当前不可用）": " (currently unavailable)",
  "<div class=\"vault-warning\"><strong>加密已完成，原明文副本仍保留</strong><p id=\"vault-plaintext-path\">⟦0⟧</p><p>确认可以解锁后，请清理原副本。以往导出的备份和源文件仍由你管理。</p><button id=\"vault-cleanup\">清理原明文副本</button></div>": "<div class=\"vault-warning\"><strong>Encrypted; original unencrypted copy kept</strong><p id=\"vault-plaintext-path\">⟦0⟧</p><p>After confirming you can unlock, clean up the original copy. Previously exported backups and source files remain under your control.</p><button id=\"vault-cleanup\">Clean up original copy</button></div>",
  "锁定设置已保存": "Lock settings saved",
  "<label class=\"field\">新密码<input id=\"vault-new-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" minlength=\"12\" maxlength=\"1024\" required placeholder=\"至少 12 个字符\"></label><label class=\"field\">再次输入<input id=\"vault-repeat-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" maxlength=\"1024\" required></label>": "<label class=\"field\">New password<input id=\"vault-new-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" minlength=\"12\" maxlength=\"1024\" required placeholder=\"At least 12 characters\"></label><label class=\"field\">Enter again<input id=\"vault-repeat-password\" type=\"password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" maxlength=\"1024\" required></label>",
  "启用历史加密": "Encrypt history",
  "<p class=\"field-help\">先保存恢复密钥，再生成并校验加密副本。转换时会结束共享、AI 和脚本任务；原明文副本保留，完成后可清理。现有导出文件不会自动加密。</p>": "<p class=\"field-help\">Save the recovery key first, then create and verify an encrypted copy. Sharing, AI and script tasks end during conversion. The original unencrypted copy is kept for cleanup afterward. Existing exports are not encrypted automatically.</p>",
  "继续，生成恢复密钥": "Create recovery key",
  "保存你的恢复密钥": "Save your recovery key",
  "<p>请保存到密码管理器或离线抄存。忘记密码时可用它恢复；密码和密钥都丢失后无法找回历史。</p><pre class=\"vault-recovery\" id=\"vault-recovery-key\">⟦0⟧</pre><label class=\"field\">填写已保存的完整恢复密钥<input id=\"vault-recovery-proof\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" maxlength=\"64\" required placeholder=\"C7-…\"></label><p class=\"field-help\">此步骤暂停记录剪贴板，10 分钟后过期并恢复记录。密钥不会自动写入文件。</p>": "<p>Save this in a password manager or write it down offline. It can restore access if you forget your password. History cannot be recovered if both the password and key are lost.</p><pre class=\"vault-recovery\" id=\"vault-recovery-key\">⟦0⟧</pre><label class=\"field\">Enter the complete recovery key you saved<input id=\"vault-recovery-proof\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" maxlength=\"64\" required placeholder=\"C7-…\"></label><p class=\"field-help\">Clipboard capture is paused during this step. It expires after 10 minutes and capture resumes. The key is not written to a file automatically.</p>",
  "历史已加密，请检查并清理原明文副本": "History encrypted. Check access, then clean up the original unencrypted copy.",
  "开始加密": "Start encryption",
  "更改历史密码": "Change history password",
  "<p class=\"field-help\">恢复密钥保持有效。更改只作用于当前目录；旧资料副本和旧备份仍使用原密码。</p>": "<p class=\"field-help\">The recovery key remains valid. This changes only the current folder; older copies and backups still use their original password.</p>",
  "当前资料的密码已更新": "Password updated for the current data",
  "更改密码": "Change password",
  "清理原明文副本": "Clean up original copy",
  "<p>将删除下列原目录中的 history.sqlite 及其日志文件：</p><pre class=\"external-preview\">⟦0⟧</pre><p class=\"field-help\">清理前会再次校验加密数据库和原副本。其他文件、备份保持原样。文件删除不等同于磁盘安全擦除。</p>": "<p>Deletes history.sqlite and its log files from this original folder:</p><pre class=\"external-preview\">⟦0⟧</pre><p class=\"field-help\">The encrypted database and original copy are verified again before cleanup. Other files and backups are kept. Deleting files is not secure disk erasure.</p>",
