  "<button data-web-revoke=\"⟦0⟧\">断开连接</button>": "<button data-web-revoke=\"⟦0⟧\">Disconnect</button>",
  "<button data-web-approve=\"⟦0⟧\">核对并允许</button><button data-web-deny=\"⟦1⟧\">拒绝</button>": "<button data-web-approve=\"⟦0⟧\">Verify & allow</button><button data-web-deny=\"⟦1⟧\">Deny</button>",
  "<p class=\"field-help\">暂无浏览器。打开邀请链接后，请在这里确认连接请求。</p>": "<p class=\"field-help\">No browsers connected. Open the invitation link, then confirm the connection request here.</p>",
  "允许浏览器连接": "Allow browser connection",
  "<p><strong>⟦0⟧</strong> · ⟦1⟧</p><p>确认浏览器显示相同验证码：<strong class=\"web-code\">⟦2⟧</strong></p><p>允许后，该浏览器可查看本次会话中所有选中内容及之后主动加入的内容。</p><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"web-allow-send\" type=\"checkbox\">同时允许发送文字与图片到本机历史</label>": "<p><strong>⟦0⟧</strong> · ⟦1⟧</p><p>Check that the browser displays the same code:<strong class=\"web-code\">⟦2⟧</strong></p><p>Once approved, this browser can view all content selected for this session and anything you add later.</p><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"web-allow-send\" type=\"checkbox\">Also allow sending text and images to local history</label>",
