  "加入共享": "Share",
  "<p class=\"field-help\">没有匹配的文字或图片记录。</p>": "<p class=\"field-help\">No matching text or image records.</p>",
  "<section class=\"tools-page web-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>网页共享</h1><p>在浏览器接收选中的文字与图片</p></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><div class=\"web-session\"><strong id=\"web-status\"></strong>⟦0⟧</div><p id=\"web-error\" class=\"sync-error\" role=\"alert\"></p>⟦1⟧</div></section>": "<section class=\"tools-page web-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>Web sharing</h1><p>Receive selected text and images in a browser</p></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><div class=\"web-session\"><strong id=\"web-status\"></strong>⟦0⟧</div><p id=\"web-error\" class=\"sync-error\" role=\"alert\"></p>⟦1⟧</div></section>",
  "<button id=\"web-stop\">结束共享</button>": "<button id=\"web-stop\">End sharing</button>",
  "<h2 class=\"section-label\">邀请浏览器</h2><p class=\"field-help\">在同一局域网打开下面的链接。先在浏览器证书详情中核对 SHA-256，与下方完全一致后再继续访问；页面请求连接后，核对双方验证码并允许。需要允许 Clipper 通过 Windows 专用网络防火墙。</p><textarea id=\"web-link\" rows=\"2\" readonly aria-label=\"网页邀请链接\"></textarea><p id=\"web-invite-expiry\" class=\"field-help\"></p><div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><button id=\"web-select-link\">选中邀请链接</button><button id=\"web-renew\">生成新邀请</button></div><details><summary>查看本次证书 SHA-256 指纹</summary><code id=\"web-fingerprint\"></code><p class=\"field-help\">每次开启会话都会更换证书。指纹不一致时不要继续访问。</p></details><h2 class=\"section-label\">浏览器连接</h2><div id=\"web-clients\"></div><h2 class=\"section-label\">共享内容</h2><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"web-follow\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦0⟧>持续共享之后新复制的文字与图片</label><p class=\"field-help\">全部已批准浏览器可见。文件、仅本机内容与邀请凭证不会共享；编辑、删除或改为仅本机会撤回。接收端已复制或另存的副本无法撤回。最多 100 项。</p><input id=\"web-search\" placeholder=\"搜索历史并选择内容\" aria-label=\"搜索可共享内容\"><div id=\"web-clips\"></div>": "<h2 class=\"section-label\">Invite a browser</h2><p class=\"field-help\">Open the link on the same LAN. Check the browser certificate's SHA-256 against the fingerprint below before continuing. When the page requests a connection, compare the codes on both sides and approve it. Windows Firewall must allow Clipper on private networks.</p><textarea id=\"web-link\" rows=\"2\" readonly aria-label=\"Web invitation link\"></textarea><p id=\"web-invite-expiry\" class=\"field-help\"></p><div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><button id=\"web-select-link\">Select invitation link</button><button id=\"web-renew\">New invitation</button></div><details><summary>View this certificate's SHA-256 fingerprint</summary><code id=\"web-fingerprint\"></code><p class=\"field-help\">A new certificate is created for each session. Do not continue if the fingerprints differ.</p></details><h2 class=\"section-label\">Browser connections</h2><div id=\"web-clients\"></div><h2 class=\"section-label\">Shared content</h2><label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"web-follow\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦0⟧>Keep sharing text and images copied from now on</label><p class=\"field-help\">Visible to all approved browsers. Files, local-only content and invitation credentials are not shared. Editing, deleting or marking content local-only retracts it. Copies already saved by recipients cannot be retracted. Up to 100 items.</p><input id=\"web-search\" placeholder=\"Search history and choose content\" aria-label=\"Search content to share\"><div id=\"web-clips\"></div>",
  "<h2 class=\"section-label\">开启临时会话</h2><p class=\"field-help\">已有历史由你逐项选择。浏览器默认仅接收，发送到本机需要另行授权。结束、到期、锁屏或休眠后关闭共享。</p><label class=\"field\">本机局域网地址<select id=\"web-host\">⟦0⟧</select></label><label class=\"field\">持续时间<select id=\"web-duration\"><option value=\"15\">15 分钟</option><option value=\"30\" selected>30 分钟</option><option value=\"60\">60 分钟</option><option value=\"120\">2 小时</option></select></label><button id=\"web-start\" class=\"primary\" ⟦1⟧>开启网页共享</button>⟦2⟧": "<h2 class=\"section-label\">Start a temporary session</h2><p class=\"field-help\">Choose existing history one item at a time. Browsers receive only by default; sending to this device requires separate permission. Sharing closes when ended, expired, locked or put to sleep.</p><label class=\"field\">Local LAN address<select id=\"web-host\">⟦0⟧</select></label><label class=\"field\">Duration<select id=\"web-duration\"><option value=\"15\">15 minutes</option><option value=\"30\" selected>30 minutes</option><option value=\"60\">60 minutes</option><option value=\"120\">2 hours</option></select></label><button id=\"web-start\" class=\"primary\" ⟦1⟧>Start web sharing</button>⟦2⟧",
  "<p class=\"field-help\">没有可用的局域网 IPv4 地址，请先连接网络。</p>": "<p class=\"field-help\">No LAN IPv4 address is available. Connect to a network first.</p>",
  "<section class=\"tools-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>文本工具</h1><p>连接模型，或用脚本处理文字</p></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>AI 服务</h2><button id=\"new-ai-profile\" class=\"primary\">添加服务</button></div><p class=\"field-help\">从文字记录打开翻译、总结或改写，预览后再发送。密钥由 Windows 加密保存，不包含在历史备份中。</p><div class=\"tool-cards\">⟦0⟧</div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>文本脚本</h2><div><button id=\"import-scripts\">导入</button><button id=\"export-scripts\">导出</button><button id=\"new-script\">新建脚本</button></div></div><p class=\"field-help\">JavaScript 只接收本次选中文字并返回文字，无法访问文件、网络或系统剪贴板。运行前可查看代码和权限。</p><div class=\"tool-cards\">⟦1⟧</div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>外部链接</h2><button id=\"toggle-integration\">⟦2⟧</button></div><p class=\"field-help\">允许其他应用通过 clipper-win:// 打开或搜索 Clipper。外部请求新增或复制文字时，始终先在应用内确认。当前：⟦3⟧。</p><div class=\"url-examples\">⟦4⟧</div></div></section>": "<section class=\"tools-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>Text tools</h1><p>Connect a model or process text with scripts</p></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>AI services</h2><button id=\"new-ai-profile\" class=\"primary\">Add service</button></div><p class=\"field-help\">Open translation, summarization or rewriting from a text record. Review the text before sending. Windows encrypts saved keys; history backups do not include them.</p><div class=\"tool-cards\">⟦0⟧</div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>Text scripts</h2><div><button id=\"import-scripts\">Import</button><button id=\"export-scripts\">Export</button><button id=\"new-script\">New script</button></div></div><p class=\"field-help\">JavaScript receives only the selected text and returns text. It cannot access files, the network or the system clipboard. Review the code and permissions before running.</p><div class=\"tool-cards\">⟦1⟧</div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>External links</h2><button id=\"toggle-integration\">⟦2⟧</button></div><p class=\"field-help\">Let other apps open or search Clipper through clipper-win://. Requests to add or copy text always need confirmation in Clipper. Status: ⟦3⟧.</p><div class=\"url-examples\">⟦4⟧</div></div></section>",
