  "<section class=\"tools-page sync-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><h1>局域网同步</h1></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\">\n<h2 id=\"sync-overview\" class=\"section-label\">设备与同步</h2>\n<div class=\"settings-card\">\n<div class=\"sync-local-row\"><label for=\"sync-name\">设备名称</label><input id=\"sync-name\" maxlength=\"60\" value=\"⟦0⟧\"></div>\n<div class=\"sync-local-row\"><div><strong>局域网同步</strong></div><label class=\"switch\"><input id=\"sync-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" aria-label=\"启用局域网同步\" ⟦1⟧><span class=\"switch-track\"></span></label></div>\n<div class=\"sync-local-row\"><div><strong>自动共享文字与图片</strong><p>仅共享开启后新复制的内容</p></div><label class=\"switch\"><input id=\"sync-auto\" type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" aria-label=\"自动同步之后新复制的文字与图片\" ⟦2⟧><span class=\"switch-track\"></span></label></div>\n<div class=\"sync-local-row\"><div><strong>自动共享文件与附件</strong><p>发送文件副本，每组最多 12 MiB</p></div><label class=\"switch\"><input id=\"sync-auto-files\" type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" aria-label=\"自动共享之后新复制的文件与附件\" ⟦3⟧><span class=\"switch-track\"></span></label></div>\n<p class=\"sync-note\">接收内容只加入历史，不会自动粘贴。源文件路径、设置和密钥不会发送。</p>\n<div class=\"sync-actions\"><button id=\"sync-save\" class=\"primary\">保存同步设置</button></div></div>\n<div id=\"sync-live\"></div>\n<h2 id=\"sync-pair-heading\" class=\"section-label\">添加设备</h2>\n<p class=\"sync-note\">两台电脑需连接同一局域网。使用一次性配对码连接，并核对设备名称。Windows 防火墙需允许 Clipper 访问专用网络。</p>\n<div class=\"sync-pair-grid\"><section class=\"settings-card\"><h3>在本机生成配对码</h3><div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><select id=\"sync-address\" aria-label=\"本机地址\">⟦4⟧</select><button id=\"sync-create\" ⟦5⟧>生成配对码</button></div><div id=\"sync-code-area\" hidden><textarea id=\"sync-invitation\" readonly rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"本机配对码\"></textarea><p id=\"sync-expiry\" class=\"field-help\"></p><div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><button id=\"sync-select-code\">选中配对码</button><button id=\"sync-cancel-code\">取消配对码</button></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"settings-card\"><h3>连接另一台设备</h3><label class=\"field\">另一台设备的配对码<textarea id=\"sync-join-code\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"4096\" placeholder=\"clipper-pair:…\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea></label><button id=\"sync-join\" ⟦6⟧>请求配对</button></section></div>\n<h2 id=\"sync-content-heading\" class=\"section-label\">共享内容</h2>\n<p class=\"sync-note\">选择记录后共享。共享记录不受自动清理影响，手动删除会同步到配对设备；离线编辑产生的不同版本会分别保留。</p>\n<div id=\"sync-clips\"></div></div></section>": "<section class=\"tools-page sync-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><h1>LAN sync</h1></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\">\n<h2 id=\"sync-overview\" class=\"section-label\">Devices & sync</h2>\n<div class=\"settings-card\">\n<div class=\"sync-local-row\"><label for=\"sync-name\">Device name</label><input id=\"sync-name\" maxlength=\"60\" value=\"⟦0⟧\"></div>\n<div class=\"sync-local-row\"><div><strong>LAN sync</strong></div><label class=\"switch\"><input id=\"sync-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Enable LAN sync\" ⟦1⟧><span class=\"switch-track\"></span></label></div>\n<div class=\"sync-local-row\"><div><strong>Share new text & images</strong><p>Only content copied after enabling sync</p></div><label class=\"switch\"><input id=\"sync-auto\" type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Automatically sync text and images copied from now on\" ⟦2⟧><span class=\"switch-track\"></span></label></div>\n<div class=\"sync-local-row\"><div><strong>Share new files & attachments</strong><p>Send file copies, up to 12 MiB per group</p></div><label class=\"switch\"><input id=\"sync-auto-files\" type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" aria-label=\"Automatically share newly copied files and attachments\" ⟦3⟧><span class=\"switch-track\"></span></label></div>\n<p class=\"sync-note\">Received content is added to history. It is never pasted automatically. Source paths, settings and keys stay on this device.</p>\n<div class=\"sync-actions\"><button id=\"sync-save\" class=\"primary\">Save sync settings</button></div></div>\n<div id=\"sync-live\"></div>\n<h2 id=\"sync-pair-heading\" class=\"section-label\">Add device</h2>\n<p class=\"sync-note\">Connect both computers to the same local network. Use a one-time pairing code and verify the device name. Allow Clipper on private networks in Windows Firewall.</p>\n<div class=\"sync-pair-grid\"><section class=\"settings-card\"><h3>Create a pairing code</h3><div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><select id=\"sync-address\" aria-label=\"Local address\">⟦4⟧</select><button id=\"sync-create\" ⟦5⟧>Create pairing code</button></div><div id=\"sync-code-area\" hidden><textarea id=\"sync-invitation\" readonly rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"This device's pairing code\"></textarea><p id=\"sync-expiry\" class=\"field-help\"></p><div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><button id=\"sync-select-code\">Select pairing code</button><button id=\"sync-cancel-code\">Cancel pairing code</button></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"settings-card\"><h3>Connect another device</h3><label class=\"field\">Pairing code from the other device<textarea id=\"sync-join-code\" rows=\"3\" maxlength=\"4096\" placeholder=\"clipper-pair:…\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea></label><button id=\"sync-join\" ⟦6⟧>Request pairing</button></section></div>\n<h2 id=\"sync-content-heading\" class=\"section-label\">Shared content</h2>\n<p class=\"sync-note\">Choose records to share. Shared records are kept during automatic cleanup. Manual deletions sync to paired devices; different edits made offline are retained separately.</p>\n<div id=\"sync-clips\"></div></div></section>",
  "<section class=\"tools-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>文本工具</h1></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>AI 服务</h2><button id=\"new-ai-profile\" class=\"primary\">添加服务</button></div><div class=\"tool-cards\">⟦0⟧</div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>文本脚本</h2><div><button id=\"import-scripts\">导入</button><button id=\"export-scripts\">导出</button><button id=\"new-script\">新建脚本</button></div></div><div class=\"tool-cards\">⟦1⟧</div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>外部链接</h2><button id=\"toggle-integration\">⟦2⟧</button></div><p class=\"field-help\">允许其他应用通过 clipper-win:// 打开或搜索 Clipper。外部请求新增或复制文字时，始终先在应用内确认。当前：⟦3⟧。</p><div class=\"url-examples\">⟦4⟧</div></div></section>": "<section class=\"tools-page\"><div class=\"page-heading\"><div><h1>Text tools</h1></div></div><div class=\"tools-scroll\"><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>AI services</h2><button id=\"new-ai-profile\" class=\"primary\">Add service</button></div><div class=\"tool-cards\">⟦0⟧</div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>Text scripts</h2><div><button id=\"import-scripts\">Import</button><button id=\"export-scripts\">Export</button><button id=\"new-script\">New script</button></div></div><div class=\"tool-cards\">⟦1⟧</div><div class=\"tools-section-heading\"><h2>External links</h2><button id=\"toggle-integration\">⟦2⟧</button></div><p class=\"field-help\">Let other apps open or search Clipper through clipper-win://. Requests to add or copy text always need confirmation in Clipper. Status: ⟦3⟧。</p><div class=\"url-examples\">⟦4⟧</div></div></section>",
