  "\n<div class=\"sharing-layout web-workbench\"><section class=\"web-connections\">\n<section class=\"settings-card web-card\"><div class=\"utility-card-heading\"><h2>⟦0⟧邀请浏览器</h2></div>\n<textarea id=\"web-link\" rows=\"2\" readonly aria-label=\"网页邀请链接\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea><p id=\"web-invite-expiry\" class=\"field-help\"></p>\n<div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><button id=\"web-copy-link\">复制邀请链接</button><button id=\"web-renew\" class=\"quiet\">生成新邀请</button></div>\n<details class=\"utility-guide\"><summary>共享范围</summary><p class=\"field-help\">全部已批准浏览器可见。文件、仅本机内容与邀请凭证不会共享；编辑、删除或改为仅本机会撤回。接收端已复制或另存的副本无法撤回。最多 100 项。</p></details>\n<details class=\"utility-guide\"><summary>连接说明</summary><p class=\"field-help\">在同一局域网打开下面的链接。先在浏览器证书详情中核对 SHA-256，与下方完全一致后再继续访问；页面请求连接后，核对双方验证码并允许。需要允许 Clipper 通过 Windows 专用网络防火墙。</p></details>\n<details class=\"utility-guide\"><summary>查看本次证书 SHA-256 指纹</summary><code id=\"web-fingerprint\"></code><p class=\"field-help\">每次开启会话都会更换证书。指纹不一致时不要继续访问。</p></details></section>\n<section class=\"settings-card web-card\"><div class=\"utility-card-heading\"><h2>⟦1⟧浏览器连接</h2></div><div id=\"web-clients\"></div></section></section>\n<section class=\"settings-card web-content-card\"><div class=\"utility-card-heading\"><h2>⟦2⟧共享内容</h2></div>\n<label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"web-follow\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦3⟧>持续共享之后新复制的文字与图片</label>\n⟦4⟧<div id=\"web-clips\"></div></section></div>": "\n<div class=\"sharing-layout web-workbench\"><section class=\"web-connections\">\n<section class=\"settings-card web-card\"><div class=\"utility-card-heading\"><h2>⟦0⟧Invite browsers</h2></div>\n<textarea id=\"web-link\" rows=\"2\" readonly aria-label=\"Web invitation link\" spellcheck=\"false\"></textarea><p id=\"web-invite-expiry\" class=\"field-help\"></p>\n<div class=\"sync-pair-row\"><button id=\"web-copy-link\">Copy invitation link</button><button id=\"web-renew\" class=\"quiet\">New invitation</button></div>\n<details class=\"utility-guide\"><summary>Sharing scope</summary><p class=\"field-help\">Visible to all approved browsers. Files, local-only content and invitation credentials are excluded. Editing, deleting or marking content local-only withdraws it. Copies already saved by recipients cannot be withdrawn. Up to 100 items.</p></details>\n<details class=\"utility-guide\"><summary>Connection guide</summary><p class=\"field-help\">Open the invitation on the same LAN. Verify that the SHA-256 fingerprint in the browser certificate exactly matches the one below before continuing. After a connection request, compare both verification codes and approve it. Allow Clipper through Windows Firewall on private networks.</p></details>\n<details class=\"utility-guide\"><summary>Session certificate SHA-256 fingerprint</summary><code id=\"web-fingerprint\"></code><p class=\"field-help\">A new certificate is generated for every session. Do not continue if the fingerprints differ.</p></details></section>\n<section class=\"settings-card web-card\"><div class=\"utility-card-heading\"><h2>⟦1⟧Browser connections</h2></div><div id=\"web-clients\"></div></section></section>\n<section class=\"settings-card web-content-card\"><div class=\"utility-card-heading\"><h2>⟦2⟧Shared content</h2></div>\n<label class=\"tool-check\"><input id=\"web-follow\" type=\"checkbox\" ⟦3⟧>Continue sharing newly copied text and images</label>\n⟦4⟧<div id=\"web-clips\"></div></section></div>",
  "\n<section class=\"settings-card web-setup-panel\"><div class=\"web-setup-intro\">⟦0⟧<h2>开启临时会话</h2><p>选择历史内容，分享给局域网中的浏览器。</p></div>\n<label class=\"field\">本机局域网地址<select id=\"web-host\">⟦1⟧</select></label>\n<label class=\"field\">持续时间<select id=\"web-duration\"><option value=\"15\">15 分钟</option><option value=\"30\" selected>30 分钟</option><option value=\"60\">60 分钟</option><option value=\"120\">2 小时</option></select></label>\n<button id=\"web-start\" class=\"primary\" ⟦2⟧>开启网页共享</button>⟦3⟧</section>": "\n<section class=\"settings-card web-setup-panel\"><div class=\"web-setup-intro\">⟦0⟧<h2>Start a temporary session</h2><p>Choose history items to share with browsers on your LAN.</p></div>\n<label class=\"field\">Local LAN address<select id=\"web-host\">⟦1⟧</select></label>\n<label class=\"field\">Duration<select id=\"web-duration\"><option value=\"15\">15 minutes</option><option value=\"30\" selected>30 minutes</option><option value=\"60\">60 minutes</option><option value=\"120\">2 hours</option></select></label>\n<button id=\"web-start\" class=\"primary\" ⟦2⟧>Start web sharing</button>⟦3⟧</section>",
